# Prototype Build Log

Narrative log for building Cloudflare Agent Dungeon while Joel learns the architecture.

The log is now data-backed: the durable machine contract lives in `.brain/data/prototype-build-log.jsonl`, and this page composes focused Brain components to render a readable timeline.

<PrototypeBuildLogProvider pageSize={6}>
  <PrototypeBuildLogSummary />
  <PrototypeBuildLogTimeline />
</PrototypeBuildLogProvider>

## Contract

- Data source: `.brain/data/prototype-build-log.jsonl`
- Schema: `PrototypeBuildLogEntry.v1` JSONL, one build-log entry per line
- Renderer components:
  - `.brain/components/PrototypeBuildLogProvider.svelte`
  - `.brain/components/PrototypeBuildLogSummary.svelte`
  - `.brain/components/PrototypeBuildLogTimeline.svelte`
  - `.brain/components/PrototypeBuildLogEntry.svelte`
- Privacy: local project Brain notes
- Side effects: none; filter/show-more controls only mutate local UI state
- Update rule: append future entries to the JSONL file, not this `.svx` shell
